graph LR
    Sim["llm-d-inference-sim"]

    %% Core Go libraries
    Sim -->|HTTP server| FastHTTP["fasthttp v1.77.0<br/>+ fasthttprouter v0.1.1"]
    Sim -->|single-port mux| Cmux["cmux v0.1.5"]
    Sim -->|gRPC + reflection| GRPC["grpc-go v1.85.0<br/>protobuf v1.36.12"]
    Sim -->|KV events| ZMQ["go-zeromq/zmq4 v0.17.0<br/>msgpack v5.4.1"]
    Sim -->|metrics| PromClient["prometheus/client_golang v1.25.0"]
    Sim -->|dataset responses| SQLite["ncruces/go-sqlite3 v0.36.0"]
    Sim -->|API types| OpenAI["openai-go v3.91.0"]
    Sim -->|validation| JSONSchema["jsonschema v5.3.1"]
    Sim -->|cert hot-reload| Fsnotify["fsnotify v1.10.1"]
    Sim -.->|logging helpers only| CR["controller-runtime v0.24.1"]

    %% Internal llm-d dependencies
    Sim -->|kvblock hashing, kvevents types| RouterLib["llm-d-router lib v0.11.0"]

    %% Runtime integrations
    Router["llm-d router / EPP"] -->|inference HTTP/gRPC, metrics scrape| Sim
    PD["llm-d P/D routing sidecar"] -->|GET /query| Sim
    Sim -->|ZMQ PUB 5557| KVIndexer["llm-d KV-cache indexer"]
    Sim -.->|HTTP 8082, optional| Render["vLLM render service<br/>vllm-openai-cpu v0.21.0"]
    Prom["Prometheus"] -->|GET /metrics| Sim

    %% External services
    Render -->|tokenizer files| HF["HuggingFace Hub"]
    Sim -.->|dataset-url flag, optional| DSURL["Dataset URL host"]

    %% Repo tools
    DSTool["dataset-tool"] -->|HTTPS| HF
    ZL["zmq-listener (debug)"] -.->|ZMQ SUB 5557| Sim

